Usage of refine:
  -activity string
    	constructing activity name
  -cases string
    	adaptive feedback cases with explicit expected outputs
  -compiler string
    	Gooo compiler executable (default "gooo")
  -evaluation-cases string
    	optional final cases withheld until source selection
  -max-attempts int
    	maximum selected activity attempt budget per refinement round (default 8)
  -max-rounds int
    	maximum source refinement rounds (1..8) (default 4)
  -model string
    	optional construction model path or builtin
  -out string
    	new output directory; original inputs stay unchanged
  -policy string
    	Gooo source revision policy
  -search-policy
    	use Gooo search observations and source-declared alternatives
  -source string
    	Gooo source containing a record construction
